Dear Refilwe,

Greetings from Vaal Hygiene Services. I am Kagiso Molefe and I am pleased to share our customer newsletter for November 2026.

Product news this month is our new refill pack for hand soap and surface cleaner. The refill uses less plastic and gives you more washes per pack. Many of our customers in offices and workshops asked for this option, so we are happy to have it ready for you.

Our seasonal tip for summer is to keep washrooms aired and bins emptied daily. Warm weather brings flies and odours quickly, so a quick morning wipe of taps and counters helps keep things fresh for staff and visitors.

Thank you to you and the team at Mzansi Plumbing for your continued support. Please let us know if there is anything we can help with in your washrooms.

Kind regards
Kagiso Molefe
Vaal Hygiene Services

